Package: spendinganalyzer
Title: Categorize and Chart Personal Transactions
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Normalises bank CSV exports, categorises transactions with
    prioritised regex rules, summarises spending by category and month,
    compares against budgets, detects recurring charges and outliers, and
    renders charts with base graphics.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: graphics, grDevices, stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
